Bitalgut_dialogic: Dialogic uses Unit Tests to ensure specific parts function as expected. These tests run on every git push and pull request. The framework to do these tests is called gdUnit4 and our tests reside in the /Tests/Unit path. We recommend installing the gdUnit4 add-on from the AssetLib, with this add-on, you can run tests locally.\
\
While you can use them, they may change in their behavior or change their signature, causing breakage in your code while moving between versions. Most private methods are used inside public ones; if you need help, check the documentation.
